{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1320425001:0":{"text":"근위대장에게 보고하러 간다고 하지 않았나요? 설마 아직도 남은 얼음 악마의 권속이 있어요?","source_cn":"你们不是去向侍卫长汇报了吗，怎么回来了？难道附近还有冰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF249BB7B3822B6DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320425002:0":{"text":"아, 아닙니다! 그 문제는 완전히 해결되었어요. 근위대장님께도 보고도 마쳤고요.","source_cn":"不，不不不！这件事已经彻底解决了，侍卫长那边也已经汇报完毕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEAA811FDE93566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320425003:1":{"text":"지금 온 이유는 감사의 뜻으로 이 서리 솔방울을 드리려고 왔습니다.","source_cn":"我这次来，是想将这些珍霜松果送给各位，以此作为感谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4BA6E3C788ABE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320425004:0":{"text":"서리 솔방울... 그게 뭐죠? 맛있을 것 같아요!","source_cn":"珍霜松果……那是什么？听上去好好吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3924D7CD2FAF5956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320425005:0":{"text":"하하, 햄스터 친구. 이건 먹는 게 아니라 아주 귀중한 선물이에요.","source_cn":"哈哈，小家伙，这可不是用来吃的，而是一种珍贵的礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB488D4E6F6A8E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320425006:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 화이트마운틴에서는 영웅이나 고마운 분들에게 서리 솔방울을 선물하곤 하지요.","source_cn":"是的。在白山公国，我们会将珍霜松果送给英雄和对自己有恩的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247F46148D07461F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320425007:0":{"text":"악마의 권속을 제거하는 데 큰 공헌을 해주셨기 때문에 특별히 솔방울을 따왔습니다. 받아주세요!","source_cn":"在清除恶魔眷属这件事上，几位的贡献不可忽视，所以我特意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE0BA0D7D125FCEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1320425007":{"text":"악마의 권속을 제거하는 데 큰 공헌을 해주셨기 때문에 특별히 솔방울을 따왔습니다. 받아주세요!","source_cn":"在清除恶魔眷属这件事上，几位的贡献不可忽视，所以我特意采摘了这些松果，还望你们能够收下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE0BA0D7D125FCEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320425009:0":{"text":"...응? 이 냄새는...","source_cn":"……嗯？这气味是……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A4407734DFE198","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...응? 이 냄새는...","female":"...응? 이 냄새는...","variant_male_record_index":"145595","variant_female_record_index":"145596","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320425010:0":{"text":"왜 그래요, 게르다 부인? 이 열매에 무슨 문제라도 있나요?","source_cn":"怎么了？格尔达女士，这些松果哪里不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADDA05D73863BC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320425011:0":{"text":"아니요, 솔방울에서 희미하게 유황 냄새가 나서요.","source_cn":"没什么，我只是在松果上闻到了很淡的硫磺气味。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x314BC9BEFD3EE732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320425012:0":{"text":"정말요?! 그렇다면 솔방울을 따온 곳 근처에 온천이 있는 거 아닐까요?","source_cn":"真的吗？！那是不是说明，在采摘松果的地方周围就有温泉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB65D7D3A5F2874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320425013:0":{"text":"꼭 그렇진 않아요. 유황 성분이 들어간 건 여러 가지가 있어서 온천과 관련 없을 수도 있어요, 그래도 한번 가봐야 알겠죠!","source_cn":"也不一定。有很多东西都包含硫磺，未必和温泉有关。不过嘛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF3901E56863D086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320425014:1":{"text":"혹시 솔방울을 어디서 땄는지 기억하세요?","source_cn":"领队，你还记得采摘松果的地方在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623660442B160F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320425015:0":{"text":"그럼요. <style=\"highlight\">여관 북쪽의 얼어붙은 강가</style>입니다. 폭포 근처에서 땄어요.","source_cn":"当然记得。就在<style=highlight>旅店北...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x409839CA38045729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320425016:0":{"text":"빨리 가봐요! 이번에는 진짜로 야외 온천을 발견할 수 있을지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"那我们就赶快过去吧！说不定真的能找到野温泉呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF642B2ABAE0DF4A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"영광이야","source_cn":"这是我的荣幸","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99139323E3B03FE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"영광이야","female":"영광이야","variant_male_record_index":"68696","variant_female_record_index":"68697","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"그럼 어쩔 수 없이 받도록 할까?","source_cn":"那我就勉为其难地收下吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0899A11FFBDFFFAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼 어쩔 수 없이 받도록 할까?","female":"그럼 어쩔 수 없이 받도록 할까?","variant_male_record_index":"68698","variant_female_record_index":"68699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320425008:0":{"text":"아...? 하하! 알겠습니다. 기억해 두겠습니다!","source_cn":"啊……？哦！好的，我记住了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA19A983CC7FA8244","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아...? 하하! 알겠습니다. 기억해 두겠습니다!","female":"아...? 하하! 알겠습니다. 기억해 두겠습니다!","variant_male_record_index":"145593","variant_female_record_index":"145594","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:2:3":{"text":"다음엔 돈으로 준비해","source_cn":"下次记得用钱犒劳我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","